"<div id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap outcome-hero split\" data-hero><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/#solutions\">← Explore solutions</a><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Compliance gaps</p><h1 class=\"display outcome-title\">Find and fix<br><span class=\"text-blue\">compliance gaps.</span></h1><p class=\"copy\">Know what needs attention. Bring missing evidence, upcoming expiries and pending reviews into one view, then follow each issue to the person’s record.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#demo\">See the review workflow <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"link\" href=\"#requirements\">See how it works ↓</a></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate\">For HR and compliance teams.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Move from a gap to an action</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Choose a record to inspect</p><div class=\"my-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose a compliance record\"><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-gap=\"missing\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Missing</button><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-gap=\"due\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Expiring</button><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-gap=\"review\" aria-pressed=\"false\">To review</button></div><div class=\"border-t border-line pt-5\"><p id=\"gap-person\" class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Riley Ellis</p><p id=\"gap-record\" class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate\">Workplace induction</p><div class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Your next action</p><p id=\"gap-action\" class=\"mt-2 font-semibold\">Request the missing evidence.</p><p id=\"gap-detail\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Check the role requirement, then ask Riley to supply the induction record.</p></div></div><p id=\"gap-announcement\" role=\"status\" class=\"sr-only\"></p></div></div></figure></section><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 border-y border-line bg-white\"><div class=\"wrap outcome-nav\"><a href=\"#requirements\" data-chapter-link=\"requirements\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">01</span>Set requirements</a><a href=\"#review\" data-chapter-link=\"review\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">02</span>Review evidence</a><a href=\"#history\" data-chapter-link=\"history\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">03</span>Follow the history</a></div></nav><div class=\"wrap\"><section id=\"requirements\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">01 / Define the requirement</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Start with the role.<br>Make the checks clear.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Set the evidence each role needs, so your team has a shared starting point when someone joins or changes role.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Your organisation decides which requirements apply and who reviews the evidence.</p><button data-open-screen class=\"link\">View role setup ↗</button></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The right starting point</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-5 text-blue\">Start with the role</p><h3 class=\"mb-1 text-2xl font-semibold\">Care assistant</h3><p class=\"mb-5 text-sm text-slate\">Your requirements shape the record.</p><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Workplace induction</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Set by your organisation</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Manual handling</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Evidence and expiry date</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Identity document</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Review by your team</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Required</span></div><div class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Jamie’s next step</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate\">Add the requested evidence.</p></div></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"review\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">02 / Inspect the evidence</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Follow each status<br>back to the record.</h2><p class=\"copy\">A missing document, an approaching expiry and an item awaiting review need different actions. See the person and requirement behind each one.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">A document on file still needs the right review. Your team makes and records that decision.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/platform/records/\">Explore expiry tracking <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">A record that stays useful</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JT</span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Care assistant</p></div></div><div class=\"pt-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Manual handling</h3><span class=\"badge bg-cream text-amber\">Due for renewal</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate\">Expiry date: 30 November 2026</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-8 border-t-2 border-blue pt-6\"><span class=\"absolute -top-2 right-[22%] h-3.5 w-3.5 border-[3px] border-white bg-blue\"></span><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate\"><p>Added to record</p><p class=\"text-right font-semibold text-amber\">Renewal approaching</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-line pt-5\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">The next action is visible</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">Arrange renewal and review the new evidence.</p></div></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"history\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">03 / Keep the context</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Show what your team<br>checked and when.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Keep evidence and review activity together. When someone asks about a check, start with the record and follow the work your team has done.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Use the record to support your process. Your organisation remains responsible for the checks it carries out.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Follow the review history</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><ol class=\"sheet flex flex-col gap-7\"><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">01</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Requirement set</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Care assistant · Workplace induction</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">02</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Evidence supplied</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Jamie adds the induction record for review.</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">03</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Review recorded</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Your team records the review and the next relevant date.</p></li></ol></div></figure></section><section class=\"split py-12 md:py-16\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Keep the work connected</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Keep the next review moving.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3\"><p class=\"copy\">Once you can see the gaps, give your team a clearer way to handle the work.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/outcomes/reduce-compliance-admin/\">Explore the admin workflow <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/\">Explore the full Certifyd story →</a></div></section></div><section id=\"demo\" class=\"bg-ink py-16 text-white md:py-20\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-[#93BBFF]\">Bring your workflow</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Bring one role.<br>Walk through the checks.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-6\"><p class=\"max-w-[43ch] text-lg text-white/80\">Show us the evidence your team needs and how you review it today. We’ll follow that workflow through Certifyd.</p><a class=\"cta bg-white text-ink hover:bg-sky\" href=\"https://cal.com/andrew-speer/certifyd-discovery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a workflow demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/75\">A 20-minute conversation with the Certifyd team.</p></div></div></section></div><dialog id=\"screen-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-title\" class=\"m-auto max-h-[94dvh] w-[min(96vw,90rem)] overflow-auto rounded-sm border border-line bg-white p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-5\"><h2 id=\"screen-title\" class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Set the requirements for each role</h2><button autofocus data-close class=\"cta\">Close</button></div><img src=\"/images/connected/roles.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1144\" alt=\"Certifyd role selection screen showing Nurse selected\" class=\"h-auto w-full\"></dialog>"
